$ Data platform
-

A *data platform* (aka data stack?) is concerned with
  • collection,
  • storage,
  • cleaning,
  • transformation,
  • analysis and
  • governance of data.


Some data platforms include
  • MongoDB
  • Teradata
  • Cloudera
  • Informatica
  • IBM watsonx
  • AWS
  • Google Cloud
  • Microsoft Fabric (allegedly bringing together Azure Data Factory, Azure Synapse and Power BI)
  • Snowflake
  • Databricks

